[00:52] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'active role in your virtual world by understanding what you ask them to do and taking action within the environment. With Convey Actions, characters can follow players, navigate their scene, interact with objects,'

[01:05] [scene:talk]
